        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Jul 29 2024 16:41:50 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>The Steri-Shield 8 personal protection system includes a helmet with three points of contact for a customizable fit, a sleeker battery, a more efficient charging station and three toga styles.</p>\n<p>Key features include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>An <b>intuitively designed helmet </b>with three points of securement for an adjustable fit and a <b>ponytail path</b> to accommodate long-haired users</li>\n<li><b>Enhanced visibility</b>, with a brighter helmet light and a 22% wider field of vision than the past generation*</li>\n<li>A <b>fan design</b> that targets the front and back of users’ necks to keep them cool</li>\n<li><b>Three toga styles</b> with AAMI level 4 (2012) protection in all critical zones, providing the highest fluid and microbial barrier for healthcare professionals*</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For more information, visit: <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/orthopaedic-instruments/products/steri-shield-8.html\">https://www.stryker.com/us/en/orthopaedic-instruments/products/steri-shield-8.html</a></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-8em\">*Stryker internal data</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Mar 03 2025 15:27:42 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
